WP-56 -- stdio slice live crossing (work in progress)

Scaffold. The stdio slice is the highest-demand real slice (24513, rank 3
behind string and the unassigned internals) and the first whose bodies are
categorically out of a freestanding harness's reach: of its 97 wired rows
exactly one is NOSIGFE (cuserid), and that body stands on the user/cygheap
state the specimen never brings up. So this crossing is the bind alone --
every stdio name resolves into the real elfsysv1.dll -- with the census fact
recorded as the finding, and body exercise left to process bring-up.

Next commits on this branch: the specimen (live-stdio.c) and its harness
(live-stdio.sh), then the README section and the decision record.
